=== Pinterest API Setup ===

1. Go to: https://developers.pinterest.com/apps/
2. Click 'Create app'
3. Fill in app name: 'SabTools Pinterest'
4. Add redirect URI: http://localhost:8086/callback
5. Copy your App ID and App Secret

Then set them in config.js or as environment variables:
  PINTEREST_APP_ID=your_app_id
  PINTEREST_APP_SECRET=your_app_secret

